  "README": [
    "THE WRITE CONTRACT FOR .claude/ — read this before any tool, agent, or human edits this tree.",
    "",
    "1. THE MANIFEST IS AUTHORITATIVE. Every file this blueprint ships is listed under `baseline`.",
    "   Every file a generator (the setup wizard, `fleet-builder`) produced is listed under",
    "   `generated`. ANY FILE NOT IN THIS MANIFEST IS OPERATOR-OWNED AND IS NEVER TOUCHED by an",
    "   upgrade, a regeneration, or an agent — not read-modified, not moved, not deleted.",
    "",
    "2. THE UPGRADE RULE (the one that matters). On `togo builder upgrade`, for each `baseline`",
    "   entry the tool recomputes the sha256 of the file on disk and compares it to the `sha256`",
    "   recorded here:",
    "     - MATCH    -> the operator never touched it. Replace it with the new baseline. Silent.",
    "     - MISMATCH -> THE FILE IS USER-EDITED AND MUST NEVER BE OVERWRITTEN SILENTLY. Write the",
    "                   incoming version alongside as `<file>.new`, set `conflict: true` on the",
    "                   entry, print the path, and move on. The operator resolves it. An upgrade",
    "                   that discards a hand-edited rule is how a fleet quietly loses its guard",
    "                   rails; it is the single failure this manifest exists to prevent.",
    "     - MISSING  -> the operator deleted it deliberately. Do not restore it. Record",
    "                   `deleted: true` and warn once.",
    "",
    "3. GENERATED FILES. Each `generated` entry carries `owner` (the only writer permitted to",
    "   touch it), `regenerate` (may a re-run of that generator replace it?), and `userEdited`.",
    "   A generator MUST recompute the sha256 before writing: if it differs from the recorded",
    "   hash, the operator edited the file — flip `userEdited: true` and LEAVE IT ALONE FOREVER,",
    "   regardless of `regenerate`. `userEdited` is a one-way latch.",
    "",
    "4. RESERVED NAMESPACES. A generator may only create files matching `reservedNamespaces`.",
    "   Baseline paths are read-only to every generator. A generated name that collides with a",
    "   baseline name is REJECTED, not overwritten — the generator picks a new slug or fails.",
    "",
    "5. REGISTRIES, NOT PROSE. Generators write DATA into the five config files listed under",
    "   `registries` (each has exactly one owner). They never write prose into a file another",
    "   owner controls. The two shared prose files (`CLAUDE.md`, `hooks/README.md`) are edited",
    "   only inside their marker blocks; a write that cannot find its markers appends a fresh",
    "   block and warns — it never rewrites the file wholesale.",
    "",
    "6. SINGLE WRITE AUTHORITY. During a feature run nothing under `.claude/**` may be written",
    "   (Rule 38, enforced by `settings.json` permissions.deny and by `guard-blast-radius.sh`).",
    "   OS changes are their own change type: launched deliberately, authored by `fleet-builder`,",
    "   reviewed by a human. The wizard writes out-of-band, before the fleet exists, so the",
    "   guard is never in its way.",
    "",
    "7. VALIDATION. `togo builder doctor --claude` asserts: every `baseline` path exists; every",
    "   hash matches or is flagged `conflict`; every agent in `team.yaml` has a file and vice",
    "   versa; every `skills:` reference resolves; every rule number is unique across baseline +",
    "   overlays + generated; no agent `name` contains `:`; no duplicate `name` in a directory;",
    "   every hook named in `settings.json` exists and is executable; `CLAUDE.md` markers are",
    "   intact and balanced. SETUP IS NOT COMPLETE UNTIL DOCTOR IS GREEN.",
    "",
    "NOTE ON THIS CHECKED-IN COPY: the `sha256` fields ship as `{{sha256:<path>}}` placeholders.",
    "`togo builder new` re-emits this file from what it actually rendered — real hashes, entries",
    "pruned for conditional files that were not written. The list below is therefore also the",
    "blueprint's completeness assertion: if a baseline path here was not rendered and is not",
    "conditional, the scaffold is broken."
  ],

  "reservedNamespaces": {
    "wizard": [
      ".claude/project.json",
      ".claude/hook-config.json",
      ".claude/forbidden-imports.json",
      ".claude/autonomy.yaml",
      ".claude/rules/4[3-9]-*.md",
      ".claude/rules/local/*.md",
      "CLAUDE.md#builder:generated"
    ],
    "fleet-builder": [
      ".claude/team.yaml",
      ".claude/agents/*.md",
      ".claude/skills/*/SKILL.md",
      ".claude/rules/local/*.md",
      "CLAUDE.md#builder:generated"
    ],
    "operator": [
      ".claude/rules/local/*.md",
      ".claude/settings.local.json",
      "CLAUDE.md#builder:operator",
      "everything not listed in this manifest"
    ]
  },

  "registries": [
    { "path": ".claude/project.json", "owner": "wizard", "contains": "project identity — the {{tokens}} every rule substitutes" },
