    "43-49": "wizard-generated project rules",
    "local/*": "operator overlays; may only TIGHTEN a baseline rule (extends: <n>, mode: tighten|narrow). A mode: relax overlay requires an operator-signed `override:` key and is printed at every session start."
  },

